url: 'https://lilydesignsystem.com/'
abstract: >-
  This is the Web Components filter helper: a headless filter builder (text, number and date ranges, limits, choices; and / or / not) that outputs JSON, SQL, MongoDB, OData or a predicate.
  It is one subproject of Lily Design System, a free open-source headless
  design system whose canonical catalog of 571 components is implemented
  across eight frameworks. Its source is the lily-design-system-web-components-filter directory
  of the canonical monorepo at https://github.com/LilyDesignSystem/lily-design-system.
